            "detailed_description": "Most stories end with the death of the protagonist. For Xzus, death is where things started to get really interesting... <br><br>Purgatory is a tactical turn-based strategy game akin to the Heroes of Might and Magic series. Guide Xzus through the immortal realm as he recruits spirits to the cause, takes on waves of increasingly-difficult foes and finally defeat the gatekeeper in order to return to the realm of the living! <br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Epic pixel art! <br></li><li>Turn-based strategy! <br></li><li>Explore the afterlife via an overworld map! <br></li><li>Acquire and spend skill points on improving your character! <br></li><li>Work your way through scores of spirit foes! <br></li><li>Recruit spirits to your cause! <br></li><li>Break out of Purgatory and regain life! <br></li><li>A prequel to the acclaimed Data Hacker series!</li></ul>",
